          "jcr:created": "Wed Jan 24 2024 19:35:28 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Built for confidence</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><br>\nEasy to use</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">MOLLI was the highest-rated device in ease of use, ergonomics and overall user experience compared to other wire-free localization technologies.<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Reliable</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">MOLLI Marker was the quickest in both marker localization and marker retrieval time with 100% of markers being successfully identified.<sup>2</sup></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">3D Directionality</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">MOLLI 2 System features 4 types of feedback to locate the MOLLI Marker including auditory, distance, visual and directionality.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 12 2026 13:34:25 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
